Draws the VDP2 scroll layers faster in hi-res and zoomed scenes (Virtua Fighter 704x224):
a heavy NBG0/NBG1 is split into two bands of lines when a layer thread is idle, and
zoomed lines reuse the previous pixel when it comes from the same source pixel.
Output is pixel-identical.

